# Component authoring

- Lifecycle: `onInit` → `onAttach` → updates/messages → `onDetach` / `onFinish` / `onRemove`.
- Register DOM/canvas listeners in `onAttach`; remove in `onDetach`.
- Set `_name` when the component must be found via `findComponentByName` under minification.
- `fixedFrequency` is optional Hz; without it, `onFixedUpdate` never runs.
- Subscribe in `onInit`/`onAttach` before relying on messages; FuncComponent auto-subscribes in `onAttach`.
- Prefer extending `ChainComponent` patterns over expanding experimental `AsyncComponent`.
- Removal path: `finish()` only works in `RUNNING` state.

See `docs/lifecycle.md` and `docs/built-in-components.md`.
